    "map_select": "Switches the map layout, routes, and areas.",
    "time_control": "Sets the store opening and closing times.",
    "customer_volume": "Customer arrivals follow exponential inter-arrival times. Formula: f(t)=λ·e^{-λt}, λ=1/μ.",
