  "info": {
    "title": "Information - Supermarket Simulator",
    "back": "Back to Main Menu",
    "content": "<h2>Welcome to the Supermarket Simulator!</h2>\n\n<p><b>Overview:</b></p>\n<p>The Supermarket Simulator is a tool for simulating and optimizing supermarket operations. You can create various scenarios, simulate customer flows, and analyze the efficiency of your virtual supermarket.</p>\n\n<p><b>Main Features:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Simulation:</b> Run realistic supermarket scenarios</li>\n<li><b>Editor:</b> Create and edit your own supermarket layouts</li>\n<li><b>Statistics:</b> Analyze customer flows and queues</li>\n<li><b>Multilingual:</b> Support for German and English</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>How it works:</b></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose a predefined map or create your own in editor mode</li>\n<li>Set simulation parameters (number of customers, opening hours, etc.)</li>\n<li>Start the simulation and watch customers shop</li>\n<li>Analyze results and optimize your layout</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><b>Tips:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Experiment with different checkout configurations</li>\n<li>Observe queues during simulation</li>\n<li>Use the editor to create new layouts</li>\n<li>Statistics help with optimization</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><i>Version 1.0 - Happy Simulating!</i></p>"
  }
